OL,3,GNEWSAThree injured after bus crashes
OL,4,Ainto 12 parked cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been injured after a
OL,7,Fbus crashed into 12 parked cars outside
OL,8,Fa railway station in East Sussex.
OL,10,FA woman was taken to hospital, and two
OL,11,Fmen were treated at the scene after the
OL,12,Fcrash at Portslade Railway Station in
OL,13,FStation Road at 14:00 BST on Tuesday,
OL,14,FSussex Police said.
OL,16,FThe bus is believed to have been
OL,17,Finvolved in a crash with one car before
OL,18,Fhitting other parked cars in the
OL,19,Fstation's car park, police added.
OL,21,FAll three people injured were other
OL,22,Fmotorists.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
